  ],
  "duration_s": 618.666667,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "三十四岁殉国，身首异处，六十二年一人牵制十万。日军致敬被低估的抗联第一硬汉。赵尚志，你见过最委屈的民族英雄吗？战场上，他是让日军瑟瑟发抖，悬赏一两骨头一两斤的东北骨头。对敌时，他铁血刚烈，百战不败，撑起整个北满。抗日江山可在自己人的阵营里，他却两次被开除党籍，常年被误解，被质疑被否定。一生为国浴血半生，背负冤屈，世人皆知，杨靖宇壮烈殉国，却极少有人独懂。赵尚志才是抗战史上最孤独、最隐忍、最让人心疼的孤勇英雄。今天，我们抛开所有细说与杜撰，用权威政史还原这位受尽委屈依旧赤诚报国的铁血将军。在中国十四年，艰苦抗战史上，有一句让无数国人热血沸腾，让日军终身忌惮的评价。小小的满洲国，大大的赵尚志。在侵略者眼中，整个伪满洲国都比不上一个赵尚志。日军为了除掉他开除天价悬赏，动用数万兵力，常年围剿部下天罗地网，派遣无数特务卧底。在敌人眼里，他是最可怕的噩梦。可在很长一段时间里，在自己人的队伍里，他确实争议最大、误会最深、最不被理解的人。一九零八年，赵尚志生于辽宁朝阳，自幼饱读诗书，秉性刚烈，心怀家国。十七岁正值青春年少，他毅然投身革命，成为东北最早一批共产党员。年少的他，一腔热狱，敢闯敢拼，为救国奔走，街头数次被捕入狱，军阀的牢狱没有磨灭。他的骨气反而让他更加坚定，唯有救亡图存，方能不负华夏。一九三一年，九一八事变爆发，东北千里，沃土，一夜沦陷，数十万东北军撤退官员南迁，富豪必祸。整个黑土地彻底陷入黑暗与绝望，所有人都在拼命逃离。东北唯独赵尚志，逆向而行，无兵、无枪、无粮、无饷，无支援，无靠山。他白手起家，深入深山密林，挨村动员奔走四方，硬生生从一片废墟里拉起一支抗日队伍。一九三三年，诸和反日游击队成立仅有十三人。九条破枪就是这样一支微不足道的小队，在赵尚志的铁血带领下创下无数奇迹。他治军急，严定了下铁律，不扰民，不劫掠不欺民别人的杂牌队伍，霍乱相里他的队伍，护佑百姓，别人为敌必战。他主动出击，逢敌必亮剑。短短数年，队伍从十几人发展到数千人，扩编，为东北抗联第三军威震北满。一九三七年，冰烫子大捷成为抗联最经典的伏击战。赵尚志利用冰雪山谷地形以少胜多，重创日军，打出了中国人的骨气，彻底震慑了盘踞东北的日寇。可谁也想不到，战场百战百胜的英雄却败给了乱世的误会与猜忌。东北抗联常年深山作战，隔绝闭塞，通讯断绝，山川阻隔，消息滞后，局势复杂，队伍打散，重组频繁。赵尚之性格刚直，做事果决，用兵激进，坚持主动出击，以战止战。但在艰苦的相持阶段，部分同志主张保存实力，谨慎避战路线，分歧、管理摩擦、信息偏差，层层叠加，最终酿成巨大冤案。一九三六年，他第一次被错误开除党籍，这份处分对一名视信仰如生命的革命者是毁灭性打击。他没有哭闹，没有辩解，没有退党，没有消沉，只留下一句震彻山河的赤骋。抗日，不分党籍，救国，不问名分，只要能打鬼子，我无怨无悔。他继续带队血战白山黑水，可命运的苛责远未停止。一九三八年北满，抗联西征惨败，队伍损失惨重，为求援，为申诉冤屈赵尚志远赴苏联，因战乱信息错位，误会。再次加深他第二次被开除党籍，两次除名。半生蒙冤有功，不赏事诚被遗浴血被冤换做任何人，早已心寒，早已放弃，早已远走高飞。但赵尚志没有世人误解我，我不愿组织委屈我，我不退山河。待我伯梁，我庇护，山河无恙，无职无名，无身份无认可。他滞留苏联三年，日日钻研敌情训练战士等待归国机会。所有人劝他局势凶险，你已受尽委屈，何必再回去送死。他自制铿锵东北，百姓还在受难，我，赵尚志，绝不独安。一九四一年，他终于争取机会，带着少数战士再度闯入虎狼遍地的东北敌战区，此时的东北早已人间炼狱。日军集团部落政策推行多年，山林无人百姓被管控，无良无缘无依无靠，抗廉，彻底陷入绝境。一九四二年二月十二日腊月末年，关将至，所有人都盼团圆，赵尚志却在雪原密林孤军坚守他千防万防日军千军万马却没能防住背后的汉奸。卧底特务刘德山假意投诚，伪装爱国骗取信任。行军途中背后冷枪骤然响起，子弹穿透，后腰，贯穿腹腔，造成致命重伤，生死一瞬铁骨依旧剧痛缠身。他依旧反手两枪，当场击毙叛徒。为保全占有保全情报。他强行命令所有人突围，自己独自断后，最终重伤被俘。正是真实记载，赵尚志腹腔重伤大出血，生命急速衰竭，并未网传数小时酷刑。但他在仅存的清醒时间里，依旧傲骨铮铮，怒斥汉江伪军。你们身为中国人，替日寇为恶良心和安我虽死，中国抗日火种永不灭。一九四二年，三十四岁，一代战神壮烈殉国，日军残忍割下头颅妖功遗体泣于雪地英雄身首异处。他这一生最动人的从不是胜仗，而是极致的赤诚与隐忍。顺境是他冲锋陷阵、为国争光。逆境时，他背负，误解，忍辱负重。绝境时，他以身殉国，无怨无悔，他可以被误会，但从未背叛信仰。他可以被亏欠，但从未亏欠。祖国四十年后，历史终于还他清白。六十二年之后，英雄终于身手合一，魂归故土，山河无恙，岁月安宁。今天的万家灯火，盛世太平，正是这位受尽委屈却一身滚烫的英雄，用血泪换来的英雄。从不是完美的神话，而是在至暗时刻明知前路艰难，依然选择逆行的普通人。赵尚志留给这片土地的火种，跨越百年，依旧滚烫。英雄无名山河，名记，风骨永存，我辈不忘。你是不是也被赵尚志的生平激励到了？评论区留下一句致敬，最孤独的铁血将军。赵尚志可以点赞、收藏、关注我，下期带你解锁更多藏在名气背后的真实人生。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00001",
      "start_ms": 130,
      "end_ms": 1530,
      "text": "三十四岁殉国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1890,
      "end_ms": 3090,
      "text": "身首异处，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00003",
      "start_ms": 3150,
      "end_ms": 6090,
      "text": "六十二年一人牵制十万。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00004",
      "start_ms": 6110,
      "end_ms": 10450,
      "text": "日军致敬被低估的抗联第一硬汉。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00005",
      "start_ms": 10630,
      "end_ms": 11350,
      "text": "赵尚志，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00006",
      "start_ms": 12370,
      "end_ms": 14810,
      "text": "你见过最委屈的民族英雄吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00007",
      "start_ms": 15230,
      "end_ms": 16010,
      "text": "战场上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00008",
      "start_ms": 16450,
      "end_ms": 18410,
      "text": "他是让日军瑟瑟发抖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00009",
      "start_ms": 19010,
      "end_ms": 23850,
      "text": "悬赏一两骨头一两斤的东北骨头。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00010",
      "start_ms": 24590,
      "end_ms": 25350,
      "text": "对敌时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00011",
      "start_ms": 26050,
      "end_ms": 27570,
      "text": "他铁血刚烈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00012",
      "start_ms": 28290,
      "end_ms": 29635,
      "text": "百战不败，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00013",
      "start_ms": 30260,
      "end_ms": 31900,
      "text": "撑起整个北满。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00014",
      "start_ms": 31960,
      "end_ms": 35020,
      "text": "抗日江山可在自己人的阵营里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00015",
      "start_ms": 35200,
      "end_ms": 37280,
      "text": "他却两次被开除党籍，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00016",
      "start_ms": 37640,
      "end_ms": 38900,
      "text": "常年被误解，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00017",
      "start_ms": 39120,
      "end_ms": 40580,
      "text": "被质疑被否定。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00018",
      "start_ms": 41020,
      "end_ms": 43460,
      "text": "一生为国浴血半生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00019",
      "start_ms": 43640,
      "end_ms": 44700,
      "text": "背负冤屈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00020",
      "start_ms": 45380,
      "end_ms": 46340,
      "text": "世人皆知，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00021",
      "start_ms": 46340,
      "end_ms": 47940,
      "text": "杨靖宇壮烈殉国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00022",
      "start_ms": 48420,
      "end_ms": 50280,
      "text": "却极少有人独懂。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00023",
      "start_ms": 51300,
      "end_ms": 59020,
      "text": "赵尚志才是抗战史上最孤独、最隐忍、最让人心疼的孤勇英雄。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00024",
      "start_ms": 59680,
      "end_ms": 60345,
      "text": "今天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00025",
      "start_ms": 60690,
      "end_ms": 63535,
      "text": "我们抛开所有细说与杜撰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00026",
      "start_ms": 63980,
      "end_ms": 72395,
      "text": "用权威政史还原这位受尽委屈依旧赤诚报国的铁血将军。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00027",
      "start_ms": 73060,
      "end_ms": 74360,
      "text": "在中国十四年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00028",
      "start_ms": 74440,
      "end_ms": 75815,
      "text": "艰苦抗战史上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00029",
      "start_ms": 76260,
      "end_ms": 80315,
      "text": "有一句让无数国人热血沸腾，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00030",
      "start_ms": 80990,
      "end_ms": 83430,
      "text": "让日军终身忌惮的评价。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00031",
      "start_ms": 83590,
      "end_ms": 84910,
      "text": "小小的满洲国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00032",
      "start_ms": 85170,
      "end_ms": 86565,
      "text": "大大的赵尚志。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00033",
      "start_ms": 87080,
      "end_ms": 88765,
      "text": "在侵略者眼中，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00034",
      "start_ms": 89280,
      "end_ms": 92605,
      "text": "整个伪满洲国都比不上一个赵尚志。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00035",
      "start_ms": 93470,
      "end_ms": 97174,
      "text": "日军为了除掉他开除天价悬赏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00036",
      "start_ms": 97660,
      "end_ms": 99295,
      "text": "动用数万兵力，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00037",
      "start_ms": 99590,
      "end_ms": 102310,
      "text": "常年围剿部下天罗地网，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00038",
      "start_ms": 102490,
      "end_ms": 104155,
      "text": "派遣无数特务卧底。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00039",
      "start_ms": 105150,
      "end_ms": 106125,
      "text": "在敌人眼里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00040",
      "start_ms": 106350,
      "end_ms": 107895,
      "text": "他是最可怕的噩梦。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00041",
      "start_ms": 108850,
      "end_ms": 110715,
      "text": "可在很长一段时间里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00042",
      "start_ms": 111150,
      "end_ms": 112625,
      "text": "在自己人的队伍里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00043",
      "start_ms": 113140,
      "end_ms": 118085,
      "text": "他确实争议最大、误会最深、最不被理解的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00044",
      "start_ms": 118600,
      "end_ms": 119715,
      "text": "一九零八年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00045",
      "start_ms": 120120,
      "end_ms": 122820,
      "text": "赵尚志生于辽宁朝阳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00046",
      "start_ms": 123020,
      "end_ms": 124440,
      "text": "自幼饱读诗书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00047",
      "start_ms": 124800,
      "end_ms": 126000,
      "text": "秉性刚烈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00048",
      "start_ms": 126400,
      "end_ms": 127500,
      "text": "心怀家国。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00049",
      "start_ms": 128099,
      "end_ms": 130720,
      "text": "十七岁正值青春年少，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00050",
      "start_ms": 131100,
      "end_ms": 132700,
      "text": "他毅然投身革命，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00051",
      "start_ms": 133060,
      "end_ms": 135620,
      "text": "成为东北最早一批共产党员。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00052",
      "start_ms": 136380,
      "end_ms": 137420,
      "text": "年少的他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00053",
      "start_ms": 137660,
      "end_ms": 138740,
      "text": "一腔热狱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00054",
      "start_ms": 139240,
      "end_ms": 140420,
      "text": "敢闯敢拼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00055",
      "start_ms": 140800,
      "end_ms": 142100,
      "text": "为救国奔走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00056",
      "start_ms": 142140,
      "end_ms": 144720,
      "text": "街头数次被捕入狱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00057",
      "start_ms": 145420,
      "end_ms": 147120,
      "text": "军阀的牢狱没有磨灭。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00058",
      "start_ms": 147120,
      "end_ms": 149785,
      "text": "他的骨气反而让他更加坚定，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00059",
      "start_ms": 150410,
      "end_ms": 151750,
      "text": "唯有救亡图存，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00060",
      "start_ms": 152110,
      "end_ms": 153430,
      "text": "方能不负华夏。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00061",
      "start_ms": 153970,
      "end_ms": 155110,
      "text": "一九三一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00062",
      "start_ms": 155350,
      "end_ms": 156850,
      "text": "九一八事变爆发，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00063",
      "start_ms": 157210,
      "end_ms": 158170,
      "text": "东北千里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00064",
      "start_ms": 158170,
      "end_ms": 158570,
      "text": "沃土，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00065",
      "start_ms": 158750,
      "end_ms": 159650,
      "text": "一夜沦陷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00066",
      "start_ms": 160110,
      "end_ms": 162710,
      "text": "数十万东北军撤退官员南迁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00067",
      "start_ms": 163050,
      "end_ms": 163970,
      "text": "富豪必祸。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00068",
      "start_ms": 164410,
      "end_ms": 167670,
      "text": "整个黑土地彻底陷入黑暗与绝望，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00069",
      "start_ms": 168330,
      "end_ms": 170250,
      "text": "所有人都在拼命逃离。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00070",
      "start_ms": 170270,
      "end_ms": 172210,
      "text": "东北唯独赵尚志，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00071",
      "start_ms": 172550,
      "end_ms": 173650,
      "text": "逆向而行，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00072",
      "start_ms": 174030,
      "end_ms": 177250,
      "text": "无兵、无枪、无粮、无饷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00073",
      "start_ms": 177650,
      "end_ms": 178390,
      "text": "无支援，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00074",
      "start_ms": 178750,
      "end_ms": 179585,
      "text": "无靠山。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00075",
      "start_ms": 180120,
      "end_ms": 181280,
      "text": "他白手起家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00076",
      "start_ms": 181620,
      "end_ms": 183020,
      "text": "深入深山密林，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00077",
      "start_ms": 183320,
      "end_ms": 185600,
      "text": "挨村动员奔走四方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00078",
      "start_ms": 186200,
      "end_ms": 190440,
      "text": "硬生生从一片废墟里拉起一支抗日队伍。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00079",
      "start_ms": 192080,
      "end_ms": 193200,
      "text": "一九三三年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00080",
      "start_ms": 193680,
      "end_ms": 197560,
      "text": "诸和反日游击队成立仅有十三人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00081",
      "start_ms": 198040,
      "end_ms": 202520,
      "text": "九条破枪就是这样一支微不足道的小队，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00082",
      "start_ms": 202600,
      "end_ms": 206840,
      "text": "在赵尚志的铁血带领下创下无数奇迹。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00083",
      "start_ms": 207580,
      "end_ms": 208740,
      "text": "他治军急，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00084",
      "start_ms": 208760,
      "end_ms": 210710,
      "text": "严定了下铁律，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00085",
      "start_ms": 211410,
      "end_ms": 212090,
      "text": "不扰民，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00086",
      "start_ms": 212430,
      "end_ms": 216390,
      "text": "不劫掠不欺民别人的杂牌队伍，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00087",
      "start_ms": 216390,
      "end_ms": 218370,
      "text": "霍乱相里他的队伍，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00088",
      "start_ms": 218370,
      "end_ms": 219150,
      "text": "护佑百姓，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00089",
      "start_ms": 219670,
      "end_ms": 221370,
      "text": "别人为敌必战。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00090",
      "start_ms": 221730,
      "end_ms": 222930,
      "text": "他主动出击，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00091",
      "start_ms": 223210,
      "end_ms": 224490,
      "text": "逢敌必亮剑。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00092",
      "start_ms": 224990,
      "end_ms": 225930,
      "text": "短短数年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00093",
      "start_ms": 226270,
      "end_ms": 229230,
      "text": "队伍从十几人发展到数千人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00094",
      "start_ms": 229530,
      "end_ms": 229890,
      "text": "扩编，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00095",
      "start_ms": 229890,
      "end_ms": 233335,
      "text": "为东北抗联第三军威震北满。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00096",
      "start_ms": 235300,
      "end_ms": 236320,
      "text": "一九三七年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00097",
      "start_ms": 236360,
      "end_ms": 241355,
      "text": "冰烫子大捷成为抗联最经典的伏击战。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00098",
      "start_ms": 242460,
      "end_ms": 246810,
      "text": "赵尚志利用冰雪山谷地形以少胜多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00099",
      "start_ms": 247050,
      "end_ms": 248165,
      "text": "重创日军，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00100",
      "start_ms": 248540,
      "end_ms": 250265,
      "text": "打出了中国人的骨气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00101",
      "start_ms": 250750,
      "end_ms": 254135,
      "text": "彻底震慑了盘踞东北的日寇。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00102",
      "start_ms": 254650,
      "end_ms": 255935,
      "text": "可谁也想不到，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00103",
      "start_ms": 256440,
      "end_ms": 262845,
      "text": "战场百战百胜的英雄却败给了乱世的误会与猜忌。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00104",
      "start_ms": 263350,
      "end_ms": 265535,
      "text": "东北抗联常年深山作战，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00105",
      "start_ms": 266040,
      "end_ms": 267125,
      "text": "隔绝闭塞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00106",
      "start_ms": 267440,
      "end_ms": 268595,
      "text": "通讯断绝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00107",
      "start_ms": 269050,
      "end_ms": 270105,
      "text": "山川阻隔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00108",
      "start_ms": 270430,
      "end_ms": 271230,
      "text": "消息滞后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00109",
      "start_ms": 271390,
      "end_ms": 272325,
      "text": "局势复杂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00110",
      "start_ms": 272670,
      "end_ms": 273470,
      "text": "队伍打散，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00111",
      "start_ms": 273550,
      "end_ms": 274565,
      "text": "重组频繁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00112",
      "start_ms": 274970,
      "end_ms": 276395,
      "text": "赵尚之性格刚直，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00113",
      "start_ms": 276670,
      "end_ms": 277575,
      "text": "做事果决，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00114",
      "start_ms": 278080,
      "end_ms": 279065,
      "text": "用兵激进，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00115",
      "start_ms": 279390,
      "end_ms": 280930,
      "text": "坚持主动出击，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00116",
      "start_ms": 281150,
      "end_ms": 282075,
      "text": "以战止战。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00117",
      "start_ms": 283060,
      "end_ms": 285000,
      "text": "但在艰苦的相持阶段，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00118",
      "start_ms": 285040,
      "end_ms": 287705,
      "text": "部分同志主张保存实力，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00119",
      "start_ms": 288540,
      "end_ms": 290990,
      "text": "谨慎避战路线，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00120",
      "start_ms": 291070,
      "end_ms": 294070,
      "text": "分歧、管理摩擦、信息偏差，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00121",
      "start_ms": 294310,
      "end_ms": 295455,
      "text": "层层叠加，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00122",
      "start_ms": 295990,
      "end_ms": 297865,
      "text": "最终酿成巨大冤案。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00123",
      "start_ms": 299660,
      "end_ms": 300700,
      "text": "一九三六年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00124",
      "start_ms": 300980,
      "end_ms": 303440,
      "text": "他第一次被错误开除党籍，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00125",
      "start_ms": 304000,
      "end_ms": 310240,
      "text": "这份处分对一名视信仰如生命的革命者是毁灭性打击。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00126",
      "start_ms": 310740,
      "end_ms": 311800,
      "text": "他没有哭闹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00127",
      "start_ms": 312140,
      "end_ms": 313060,
      "text": "没有辩解，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00128",
      "start_ms": 313320,
      "end_ms": 314200,
      "text": "没有退党，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00129",
      "start_ms": 314440,
      "end_ms": 315280,
      "text": "没有消沉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00130",
      "start_ms": 315660,
      "end_ms": 318620,
      "text": "只留下一句震彻山河的赤骋。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00131",
      "start_ms": 319220,
      "end_ms": 319760,
      "text": "抗日，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00132",
      "start_ms": 319980,
      "end_ms": 320960,
      "text": "不分党籍，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00133",
      "start_ms": 321560,
      "end_ms": 322160,
      "text": "救国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00134",
      "start_ms": 322400,
      "end_ms": 323360,
      "text": "不问名分，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00135",
      "start_ms": 323920,
      "end_ms": 325160,
      "text": "只要能打鬼子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00136",
      "start_ms": 325440,
      "end_ms": 326660,
      "text": "我无怨无悔。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00137",
      "start_ms": 326760,
      "end_ms": 329870,
      "text": "他继续带队血战白山黑水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00138",
      "start_ms": 330570,
      "end_ms": 333750,
      "text": "可命运的苛责远未停止。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00139",
      "start_ms": 334750,
      "end_ms": 337110,
      "text": "一九三八年北满，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00140",
      "start_ms": 337130,
      "end_ms": 338470,
      "text": "抗联西征惨败，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00141",
      "start_ms": 339130,
      "end_ms": 340510,
      "text": "队伍损失惨重，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00142",
      "start_ms": 341450,
      "end_ms": 342250,
      "text": "为求援，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00143",
      "start_ms": 343210,
      "end_ms": 347090,
      "text": "为申诉冤屈赵尚志远赴苏联，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00144",
      "start_ms": 347510,
      "end_ms": 349430,
      "text": "因战乱信息错位，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00145",
      "start_ms": 349790,
      "end_ms": 350210,
      "text": "误会。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00146",
      "start_ms": 350330,
      "end_ms": 353670,
      "text": "再次加深他第二次被开除党籍，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00147",
      "start_ms": 354170,
      "end_ms": 355290,
      "text": "两次除名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00148",
      "start_ms": 355550,
      "end_ms": 357510,
      "text": "半生蒙冤有功，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00149",
      "start_ms": 357530,
      "end_ms": 362795,
      "text": "不赏事诚被遗浴血被冤换做任何人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00150",
      "start_ms": 363670,
      "end_ms": 364975,
      "text": "早已心寒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00151",
      "start_ms": 365720,
      "end_ms": 366815,
      "text": "早已放弃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00152",
      "start_ms": 367660,
      "end_ms": 369295,
      "text": "早已远走高飞。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00153",
      "start_ms": 370340,
      "end_ms": 373085,
      "text": "但赵尚志没有世人误解我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00154",
      "start_ms": 373330,
      "end_ms": 375530,
      "text": "我不愿组织委屈我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00155",
      "start_ms": 375630,
      "end_ms": 377300,
      "text": "我不退山河。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00156",
      "start_ms": 377400,
      "end_ms": 378365,
      "text": "待我伯梁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00157",
      "start_ms": 378720,
      "end_ms": 379400,
      "text": "我庇护，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00158",
      "start_ms": 379500,
      "end_ms": 380375,
      "text": "山河无恙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00159",
      "start_ms": 380860,
      "end_ms": 382200,
      "text": "无职无名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00160",
      "start_ms": 382620,
      "end_ms": 384435,
      "text": "无身份无认可。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00161",
      "start_ms": 385370,
      "end_ms": 386705,
      "text": "他滞留苏联三年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00162",
      "start_ms": 387320,
      "end_ms": 392085,
      "text": "日日钻研敌情训练战士等待归国机会。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00163",
      "start_ms": 392750,
      "end_ms": 395425,
      "text": "所有人劝他局势凶险，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00164",
      "start_ms": 395900,
      "end_ms": 397220,
      "text": "你已受尽委屈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00165",
      "start_ms": 397560,
      "end_ms": 399095,
      "text": "何必再回去送死。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00166",
      "start_ms": 399460,
      "end_ms": 401390,
      "text": "他自制铿锵东北，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00167",
      "start_ms": 401470,
      "end_ms": 402765,
      "text": "百姓还在受难，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00168",
      "start_ms": 403430,
      "end_ms": 403670,
      "text": "我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00169",
      "start_ms": 403670,
      "end_ms": 404385,
      "text": "赵尚志，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00170",
      "start_ms": 404690,
      "end_ms": 405415,
      "text": "绝不独安。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00171",
      "start_ms": 406570,
      "end_ms": 407555,
      "text": "一九四一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00172",
      "start_ms": 408400,
      "end_ms": 410215,
      "text": "他终于争取机会，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00173",
      "start_ms": 411040,
      "end_ms": 416105,
      "text": "带着少数战士再度闯入虎狼遍地的东北敌战区，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00174",
      "start_ms": 416630,
      "end_ms": 419865,
      "text": "此时的东北早已人间炼狱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00175",
      "start_ms": 420480,
      "end_ms": 424225,
      "text": "日军集团部落政策推行多年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00176",
      "start_ms": 424550,
      "end_ms": 427375,
      "text": "山林无人百姓被管控，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00177",
      "start_ms": 427790,
      "end_ms": 430185,
      "text": "无良无缘无依无靠，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00178",
      "start_ms": 431060,
      "end_ms": 431560,
      "text": "抗廉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00179",
      "start_ms": 431720,
      "end_ms": 432995,
      "text": "彻底陷入绝境。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00180",
      "start_ms": 433450,
      "end_ms": 437040,
      "text": "一九四二年二月十二日腊月末年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00181",
      "start_ms": 437040,
      "end_ms": 437805,
      "text": "关将至，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00182",
      "start_ms": 438540,
      "end_ms": 440115,
      "text": "所有人都盼团圆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00183",
      "start_ms": 440510,
      "end_ms": 449830,
      "text": "赵尚志却在雪原密林孤军坚守他千防万防日军千军万马却没能防住背后的汉奸。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00184",
      "start_ms": 449910,
      "end_ms": 453510,
      "text": "卧底特务刘德山假意投诚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00185",
      "start_ms": 453710,
      "end_ms": 456315,
      "text": "伪装爱国骗取信任。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00186",
      "start_ms": 456840,
      "end_ms": 460595,
      "text": "行军途中背后冷枪骤然响起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00187",
      "start_ms": 461110,
      "end_ms": 461870,
      "text": "子弹穿透，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00188",
      "start_ms": 461870,
      "end_ms": 462355,
      "text": "后腰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00189",
      "start_ms": 462630,
      "end_ms": 463525,
      "text": "贯穿腹腔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00190",
      "start_ms": 463850,
      "end_ms": 465275,
      "text": "造成致命重伤，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00191",
      "start_ms": 465970,
      "end_ms": 469745,
      "text": "生死一瞬铁骨依旧剧痛缠身。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00192",
      "start_ms": 470430,
      "end_ms": 472025,
      "text": "他依旧反手两枪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00193",
      "start_ms": 472380,
      "end_ms": 473835,
      "text": "当场击毙叛徒。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00194",
      "start_ms": 474230,
      "end_ms": 476655,
      "text": "为保全占有保全情报。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00195",
      "start_ms": 477190,
      "end_ms": 479415,
      "text": "他强行命令所有人突围，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00196",
      "start_ms": 479760,
      "end_ms": 480995,
      "text": "自己独自断后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00197",
      "start_ms": 481390,
      "end_ms": 482985,
      "text": "最终重伤被俘。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00198",
      "start_ms": 484780,
      "end_ms": 486005,
      "text": "正是真实记载，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00199",
      "start_ms": 486450,
      "end_ms": 489535,
      "text": "赵尚志腹腔重伤大出血，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00200",
      "start_ms": 490170,
      "end_ms": 491685,
      "text": "生命急速衰竭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00201",
      "start_ms": 492060,
      "end_ms": 494955,
      "text": "并未网传数小时酷刑。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00202",
      "start_ms": 495210,
      "end_ms": 497705,
      "text": "但他在仅存的清醒时间里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00203",
      "start_ms": 498080,
      "end_ms": 499615,
      "text": "依旧傲骨铮铮，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00204",
      "start_ms": 500000,
      "end_ms": 501245,
      "text": "怒斥汉江伪军。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00205",
      "start_ms": 501800,
      "end_ms": 503035,
      "text": "你们身为中国人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00206",
      "start_ms": 503370,
      "end_ms": 507395,
      "text": "替日寇为恶良心和安我虽死，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00207",
      "start_ms": 507840,
      "end_ms": 510355,
      "text": "中国抗日火种永不灭。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00208",
      "start_ms": 511010,
      "end_ms": 511970,
      "text": "一九四二年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00209",
      "start_ms": 511970,
      "end_ms": 512795,
      "text": "三十四岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00210",
      "start_ms": 513410,
      "end_ms": 515835,
      "text": "一代战神壮烈殉国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00211",
      "start_ms": 516310,
      "end_ms": 523175,
      "text": "日军残忍割下头颅妖功遗体泣于雪地英雄身首异处。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00212",
      "start_ms": 523770,
      "end_ms": 527495,
      "text": "他这一生最动人的从不是胜仗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00213",
      "start_ms": 528030,
      "end_ms": 531185,
      "text": "而是极致的赤诚与隐忍。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00214",
      "start_ms": 531970,
      "end_ms": 535835,
      "text": "顺境是他冲锋陷阵、为国争光。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00215",
      "start_ms": 536360,
      "end_ms": 537140,
      "text": "逆境时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00216",
      "start_ms": 537340,
      "end_ms": 538080,
      "text": "他背负，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00217",
      "start_ms": 538140,
      "end_ms": 538655,
      "text": "误解，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00218",
      "start_ms": 539080,
      "end_ms": 540165,
      "text": "忍辱负重。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00219",
      "start_ms": 540810,
      "end_ms": 541695,
      "text": "绝境时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00220",
      "start_ms": 542130,
      "end_ms": 543425,
      "text": "他以身殉国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00221",
      "start_ms": 543870,
      "end_ms": 544735,
      "text": "无怨无悔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00222",
      "start_ms": 545100,
      "end_ms": 546205,
      "text": "他可以被误会，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00223",
      "start_ms": 546670,
      "end_ms": 548845,
      "text": "但从未背叛信仰。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00224",
      "start_ms": 549220,
      "end_ms": 550335,
      "text": "他可以被亏欠，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00225",
      "start_ms": 550800,
      "end_ms": 552340,
      "text": "但从未亏欠。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00226",
      "start_ms": 552360,
      "end_ms": 554265,
      "text": "祖国四十年后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00227",
      "start_ms": 554610,
      "end_ms": 556485,
      "text": "历史终于还他清白。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00228",
      "start_ms": 556970,
      "end_ms": 558295,
      "text": "六十二年之后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00229",
      "start_ms": 558630,
      "end_ms": 560670,
      "text": "英雄终于身手合一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00230",
      "start_ms": 561030,
      "end_ms": 562145,
      "text": "魂归故土，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00231",
      "start_ms": 562460,
      "end_ms": 563425,
      "text": "山河无恙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00232",
      "start_ms": 563840,
      "end_ms": 564755,
      "text": "岁月安宁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00233",
      "start_ms": 565710,
      "end_ms": 567345,
      "text": "今天的万家灯火，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00234",
      "start_ms": 567690,
      "end_ms": 568575,
      "text": "盛世太平，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00235",
      "start_ms": 569220,
      "end_ms": 574005,
      "text": "正是这位受尽委屈却一身滚烫的英雄，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00236",
      "start_ms": 574490,
      "end_ms": 577620,
      "text": "用血泪换来的英雄。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00237",
      "start_ms": 577740,
      "end_ms": 579380,
      "text": "从不是完美的神话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00238",
      "start_ms": 579480,
      "end_ms": 582915,
      "text": "而是在至暗时刻明知前路艰难，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00239",
      "start_ms": 583270,
      "end_ms": 585655,
      "text": "依然选择逆行的普通人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00240",
      "start_ms": 586330,
      "end_ms": 589155,
      "text": "赵尚志留给这片土地的火种，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00241",
      "start_ms": 589520,
      "end_ms": 590665,
      "text": "跨越百年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00242",
      "start_ms": 591030,
      "end_ms": 592065,
      "text": "依旧滚烫。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00243",
      "start_ms": 594170,
      "end_ms": 596140,
      "text": "英雄无名山河，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00244",
      "start_ms": 596140,
      "end_ms": 596665,
      "text": "名记，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00245",
      "start_ms": 596950,
      "end_ms": 597985,
      "text": "风骨永存，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00246",
      "start_ms": 598390,
      "end_ms": 599310,
      "text": "我辈不忘。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00247",
      "start_ms": 599910,
      "end_ms": 603010,
      "text": "你是不是也被赵尚志的生平激励到了？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00248",
      "start_ms": 603250,
      "end_ms": 606130,
      "text": "评论区留下一句致敬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00249",
      "start_ms": 606310,
      "end_ms": 608930,
      "text": "最孤独的铁血将军。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00250",
      "start_ms": 609130,
      "end_ms": 612470,
      "text": "赵尚志可以点赞、收藏、关注我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8523cb0b5d61787a_s00251",
      "start_ms": 613150,
      "end_ms": 618535,
      "text": "下期带你解锁更多藏在名气背后的真实人生。"
    }
  ],
